you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.190" end="00:12.330"><span begin="00:11.190" end="00:11.370">I </span><span begin="00:11.370" end="00:11.610">get </span><span begin="00:11.610" end="00:11.850">so </span><span begin="00:11.850" end="00:12.330">hungry</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.330" end="00:13.230"><span begin="00:12.330" end="00:12.450">When </span><span begin="00:12.450" end="00:12.540">you </span><span begin="00:12.540" end="00:12.690">say </span><span begin="00:12.690" end="00:12.780">you </span><span begin="00:12.780" end="00:13.020">love </span><span begin="00:13.020" end="00:13.230">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.230" end="00:15.030"><span begin="00:13.230" end="00:13.440">Hush</span><span begin="00:13.440" end="00:13.470">, </span><span begin="00:13.470" end="00:13.620">if </span><span begin="00:13.620" end="00:13.740">you </span><span begin="00:13.740" end="00:13.890">know </span><span begin="00:13.890" end="00:14.160">what's </span><span begin="00:14.160" end="00:14.370">good </span><span begin="00:14.370" end="00:14.610">for </span><span begin="00:14.610" end="00:15.030">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.030" end="00:16.710"><span begin="00:15.030" end="00:15.270">I </span><span begin="00:15.270" end="00:15.480">think </span><span begin="00:15.480" end="00:15.570">you're </span><span begin="00:15.570" end="00:15.870">hot</span><span begin="00:15.870" end="00:15.870">, </span><span begin="00:15.870" end="00:15.990">I </span><span begin="00:15.990" end="00:16.260">think </span><span begin="00:16.260" end="00:16.440">you're </span><span begin="00:16.440" end="00:16.710">cool</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.710" end="00:18.570"><span begin="00:16.710" end="00:16.950">You're </span><span begin="00:16.950" end="00:17.100">the </span><span begin="00:17.100" end="00:17.370">kind </span><span begin="00:17.370" end="00:17.430">of </span><span begin="00:17.430" end="00:17.700">guy </span><span begin="00:17.700" end="00:17.820">I'd </span><span begin="00:17.820" end="00:18.150">stalk </span><span begin="00:18.150" end="00:18.300">in </span><span begin="00:18.300" end="00:18.570">school</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.570" end="00:19.740"><span begin="00:18.570" end="00:18.780">But </span><span begin="00:18.780" end="00:18.930">now </span><span begin="00:18.930" end="00:19.080">that </span><span begin="00:19.080" end="00:19.260">I'm </span><span begin="00:19.260" end="00:19.740">famous</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.740" end="00:20.730"><span begin="00:19.740" end="00:19.920">You're </span><span begin="00:19.920" end="00:20.040">up </span><span begin="00:20.040" end="00:20.220">my </span><span begin="00:20.220" end="00:20.730">anus</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.790" end="00:22.560"><span begin="00:20.790" end="00:21.150">Now </span><span begin="00:21.150" end="00:21.360">I'm </span><span begin="00:21.360" end="00:21.570">gonna </span><span begin="00:21.570" end="00:21.840">eat </span><span begin="00:21.840" end="00:21.990">you</span><span begin="00:21.990" end="00:21.990">, </span><span begin="00:21.990" end="00:22.560">fool</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.560" end="00:23.910"><span begin="00:22.560" end="00:22.830">I </span><span begin="00:22.830" end="00:23.160">eat </span><span begin="00:23.160" end="00:23.520">boys </span><span begin="00:23.520" end="00:23.910">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.240" end="00:25.950"><span begin="00:24.240" end="00:25.050">Breakfast </span><span begin="00:25.050" end="00:25.230">and </span><span begin="00:25.230" end="00:25.950">lunch</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.980" end="00:27.960"><span begin="00:25.980" end="00:26.520">Then </span><span begin="00:26.520" end="00:26.880">when </span><span begin="00:26.880" end="00:27.060">I'm </span><span begin="00:27.060" end="00:27.960">thirsty</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.050" end="00:29.730"><span begin="00:28.050" end="00:28.290">I </span><span begin="00:28.290" end="00:28.710">drink </span><span begin="00:28.710" end="00:28.920">their </span><span begin="00:28.920" end="00:29.730">blood</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.760" end="00:31.620"><span begin="00:29.760" end="00:30.810">Carnivore</span><span begin="00:30.810" end="00:30.810">, </span><span begin="00:30.810" end="00:31.620">animal</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.740" end="00:33.450"><span begin="00:31.740" end="00:32.040">I </span><span begin="00:32.040" end="00:32.400">am </span><span begin="00:32.400" end="00:32.550">a </span><span begin="00:32.550" end="00:33.450">cannibal</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.540" end="00:34.980"><span begin="00:33.540" end="00:33.840">I </span><span begin="00:33.840" end="00:34.200">eat </span><span begin="00:34.200" end="00:34.560">boys </span><span begin="00:34.560" end="00:34.980">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.310" end="00:37.290"><span begin="00:35.310" end="00:35.670">You </span><span begin="00:35.670" end="00:36.300">better </span><span begin="00:36.300" end="00:37.290">run</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.350" end="00:44.130"><span begin="00:37.350" end="00:39.120">I </span><span begin="00:39.120" end="00:40.830">am </span><span begin="00:40.830" end="00:42.870">cannibal </span><span begin="00:42.870" end="00:43.740">cannibal </span><span begin="00:43.740" end="00:44.010">i </span><span begin="00:44.010" end="00:44.130">am</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.670" end="00:50.100"><span begin="00:44.670" end="00:46.470">I </span><span begin="00:46.470" end="00:48.000">am </span><span begin="00:48.000" end="00:50.100">cannibal</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.220" end="00:51.570"><span begin="00:50.220" end="00:50.550">I'll </span><span begin="00:50.550" end="00:50.910">eat </span><span begin="00:50.910" end="00:51.300">you </span><span begin="00:51.300" end="00:51.570">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.080" end="00:57.270"><span begin="00:52.080" end="00:53.910">I </span><span begin="00:53.910" end="00:55.590">am </span><span begin="00:55.590" end="00:57.270">cannibal</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.560" end="01:05.040"><span begin="00:58.560" end="01:01.290">I </span><span begin="01:01.290" end="01:03.000">am </span><span begin="01:03.000" end="01:05.040">cannibal</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.040" end="01:06.390"><span begin="01:05.040" end="01:05.310">I'll </span><span begin="01:05.310" end="01:05.700">eat </span><span begin="01:05.700" end="01:06.090">you </span><span begin="01:06.090" end="01:06.390">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.630" end="01:08.610"><span begin="01:06.630" end="01:07.230">Whenever </span><span begin="01:07.230" end="01:07.410">you </span><span begin="01:07.410" end="01:07.680">tell </span><span begin="01:07.680" end="01:07.950">me </span><span begin="01:07.950" end="01:08.130">I'm </span><span begin="01:08.130" end="01:08.610">pretty</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.610" end="01:10.470"><span begin="01:08.610" end="01:08.910">That's </span><span begin="01:08.910" end="01:09.000">when </span><span begin="01:09.000" end="01:09.060">the </span><span begin="01:09.060" end="01:09.570">hunger </span><span begin="01:09.570" end="01:10.020">really </span><span begin="01:10.020" end="01:10.260">hits </span><span begin="01:10.260" end="01:10.470">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.470" end="01:12.330"><span begin="01:10.470" end="01:10.740">Your </span><span begin="01:10.740" end="01:10.950">little </span><span begin="01:10.950" end="01:11.160">heart </span><span begin="01:11.160" end="01:11.370">goes </span><span begin="01:11.370" end="01:11.790">pitter </span><span begin="01:11.790" end="01:12.330">patter</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.390" end="01:14.160"><span begin="01:12.390" end="01:12.510">I </span><span begin="01:12.510" end="01:12.720">want </span><span begin="01:12.720" end="01:12.810">your </spa